# Every image builds with the repo root as its context, for the workspaces lockfile.
# Each Dockerfile copies only the paths it needs; this keeps the context small.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/logs
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
terraform
deployment
monitoring
backend/database
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
